# Fixed schema ids for liquidity-validator-service (the live READ-ONLY liquidity validator; NEW, dev only). Contracts options-edge-contracts 0.73.0 (schemas-registry/liquidityvalidator):
# ids 3601-3604 (3601 = version 1 of the evaluation subject, ARCHIVAL since contracts 0.76.0; 3604 = version 2, the formation reading; a registered id never changes content), version 1 except 3604 (see the fourth column, es-trade-tools.map), namespace com.optionsedge.contracts.liquidityvalidator, subject = the record full name (RecordNameStrategy), compatibility FULL. One record TYPE per topic:
